msgctxt "Q1LbhS"
msgid "New career"
msgstr "Beruflicher Neustart"

#. {goal} is an example goal like “become a data analyst in 6 months”; <quote> puts your language's quote marks around it. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Diga aonde quer chegar, como <quote>{goal}</quote>. O plano vai do básico às ferramentas da área e pula o que você já sabe.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "a5TSiQ"
msgid "Say where you want to get, like <quote>{goal}</quote>. Your plan goes from the basics to the tools of the field and skips what you already know."
msgstr "Sag, was du erreichen möchtest, zum Beispiel <quote>{goal}</quote>. Dein Plan führt dich von den Grundlagen bis zu den Werkzeugen für deinen Beruf und überspringt, was du schon weißt."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Para mudar de área, o que estudar e em que ordem.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "O5V56t"
msgid "Changing careers? What to study, and in what order."
msgstr "Beruf wechseln? Was du dafür lernst und in welcher Reihenfolge."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Todo plano funciona assim”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "UMn7XD"
msgid "Every plan works like this"
msgstr "So funktioniert jeder Plan"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Começa pelo que você já sabe”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "-g3daz"
msgid "It starts from what you know"
msgstr "Er baut auf dem auf, was du schon weißt"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Umas perguntas rápidas, em cerca de 2 minutos, e o plano pula o que você já sabe.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "7HSrMH"
msgid "A few quick questions, about 2 minutes, and your plan skips what you already know."
msgstr "Ein paar kurze Fragen in etwa 2 Minuten, und dein Plan überspringt, was du schon weißt."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Se faltar um dia, ele se ajusta”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "HZOzEA"
msgid "Miss a day and it adjusts"
msgstr "Wenn du einen Tag aussetzt, passt er sich an"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “O que ficou pendente vem primeiro no dia seguinte. Se alguma data mudar, o plano te avisa.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "s-aYFw"
msgid "What's left comes first the next day. If a date changes, your plan tells you."
msgstr "Was noch offen ist, kommt am nächsten Tag zuerst dran. Wenn sich ein Termin ändert, sagt dein Plan dir Bescheid."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Revisa antes de você esquecer”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "Mpxf-A"
msgid "It reviews before you forget"
msgstr "Wiederholungen, bevor du etwas vergisst"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Revisões rápidas na hora certa, e cada erro volta para você praticar até acertar.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "iegI6Q"
msgid "Quick reviews at the right time, and every mistake comes back for you to practice until you get it right."
msgstr "Kurze Wiederholungen zur richtigen Zeit. Was du falsch beantwortest, kommt zum Üben wieder, bis du es richtig kannst."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Travou? É só perguntar”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "yUieOB"
msgid "Stuck? Just ask"
msgstr "Kommst du nicht weiter? Frag einfach"

#. The question is the one the learner is answering. In Brazilian Portuguese: “A gente explica ali mesmo na questão, do jeito mais simples que você precisar.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "m1tYsa"
msgid "We explain right there in the question, as simply as you need."
msgstr "Wir erklären es dir direkt bei der Frage, so einfach, wie du es brauchst."

